# MOTHER3 (AGB-A3UJ): the signs and kanji of the game's font by their numbers, as the script has them (16-bit, the
# low byte first). Kana follow a rule and are not listed (the script has it). Each was read in play: the words of
# a text the game was showing beside the characters on screen.
0200=。
0500=・
0800=？
0900=！
1B00=ー
3500=「
3600=」
5D00=◇
5E00=◆
AC00=　
DD00=Ｂ
